Key Features Built:
AI Visual Skin Routine Diagnosis Wizard: Interactive step-by-step quiz calculating personalized regimens with single-click cart injection.
Real-Time Overseas Shipment Radar: Live radar visualizer with flight track status from Seoul/Guangzhou to Dhaka Customs clearance.
Voice-Guided Assistant & Multi-Lingual Tone Switcher: Web Speech API audio simulation, animated audio visualizer bars, and instant tone switching (Royal English, Banglish, Bengali).
